  "body": "[notein] outputs MIDI note messages: the note number, velocity and channel. A release comes out as velocity 0. It listens on all channels by default; an argument sets the channel and removes the channel outlet. Channels above 16 address further ports: 17 to 32 are channels 1 to 16 of port 2, and so on."
